  "details": "Desktop-only install. Window is black from startup, audio plays (login music). Never get a visible login UI.\n\nPC: Beelink SER9 (AZW), AMD Ryzen 7 255 with Radeon 780M, 32 GB RAM, Windows 11 24H2 (10.0.26100)\n\nClient: Steam, first install. Reproduced on live and Open Beta. Both report build 2026.3.2-1901-4a7d603ee0-Release, Unity 2022.3.22f2-DWR.\n\nTried: --no-vr, -force-d3d11, -force-d3d12, windowed, prefs/registry wipe, file verify. GPU is correctly AMD Radeon 780M Graphics in the log.\n\nLog pattern every launch:\n\nActivating login loading screen\n\nCreated Stacked Camera : Cam_InternalUI\n\nNullReferenceException on the camera stack\n\nManual login failed. Will prompt again.\n\nOutput logs attached.\n\nNot for me, My friend is having issues even booting up the game, here are the logs for everything",
